Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: baobab
Description: file manager for Wayland with tabs and a split view
 Gimbal Files is a GTK 4 and libadwaita file manager for Wayland. It has
 tabs and a split view, a keyboard-driven command registry, file operations
 with undo, previews, drag and drop, and drive mounting.
